From: AdobeWine
Subject: [PATCH] Stubs Adobe's apps import from subsystems Wine lacks fail cleanly.

WinUSB, Bluetooth GATT, ESE, WebSocket, filter manager, event tracing, TPM, and a few crypt32 and rpcrt4 calls were "@ stub", and
calling one aborts the process. They now return the error a machine without that subsystem gives, so code that checks
for the feature carries on. Nothing here makes those subsystems work.
Test: wine/tests/gapmap.

---
